Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:14.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan!\NIt's morning!\NWake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:19.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.75,0:00:24.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:27.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come down soon, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:29.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I slept well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:43.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:46.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Onee, breakfast's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.61,0:00:55.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Iori.\NI overslept again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.07,0:01:00.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's fine, that's fine!\NYou worked all night. Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.49,0:01:04.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At least drink this before you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot the sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.29,0:01:09.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.\NThis is all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.51,0:01:14.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you burn yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:17.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.10,0:01:29.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's that, Yoshifumi? A friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.19,0:01:32.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one!\NDon't read my texts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.94,0:01:35.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Heading out, Himeko?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.11,0:01:37.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, are you blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:41.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should lighten up.\NYou'll never get a boyfriend like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:43.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.41,0:01:47.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning, Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.37,0:01:48.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still sleepy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.54,0:01:50.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How are you so full of energy every morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:54.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unlike you, I don't watch wrestling all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.96,0:01:58.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning, Inaban!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.43,0:02:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, you two come to school together?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.68,0:02:05.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no. We ran into each other over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.14,0:02:08.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh? Yui! Aoki! Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.86,0:02:12.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:16.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's almost October, but it's still so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.36,0:02:18.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Personally, I think this is just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:23.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} just can't tell when the season changes.\NRight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:26.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? S-Sure. {Su-Sure?}{i take stutters phonetically because it keeps things consistent}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.85,0:04:14.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here at Yamaboshi High School,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:17.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}all students are required to join a club and participate in its activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:24.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But while most wolves hunt in packs, no matter where you go, there will always be lone wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:28.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}For example, me, who loves wrestling more than anything
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.28,0:04:33.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and wrote the name of a nonexistent club, the Professional Wrestling Research Society, on my form.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.62,0:04:37.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or, for example,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.62,0:04:42.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Kiriyama Yui, who loves cute things and hoped to join the long-defunct Fancy Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:46.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or, for example,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:51.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aoki Yoshifumi, who sincerely believed that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.55,0:04:51.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}a club that "hit the town" every night existed and tried to join it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:55.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or, for example,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:59.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Nagase Iori, who thought that, with so many clubs, choosing one would be a hassle
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:05:03.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}and that leaving the selection to the breeze might give her a fresh and exciting experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:07.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so she left her club selection \Nto her homeroom teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:11.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or, for example,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:17.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba Himeko, who intended to join the Computing Club, but soon had a falling out with its president,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:17.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and ended up having to search for another club.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:21.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh?\NYou're the only one here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:22.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:27.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so, these five first-years with nowhere else to go
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:31.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,were lumped together into the newly formed Cultural Research Club,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.18,0:05:34.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or CRC for short.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:39.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got an idea for your next article in the CRC News, Taichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:40.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.81,0:05:44.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The title is "A History of Professional Wrestling Through Variants of the Brainbuster."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.99,0:05:48.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These days, it's common for a brainbuster to involve slamming from the back,{w}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:51.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}but originally, it was a move where you slammed them from the head—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.45,0:05:52.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.45,0:05:54.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:57.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I only asked if you had an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:06:01.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made no reference to the content of your article,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:02.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nor do I want to hear about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:05.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As blunt as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.21,0:06:09.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! I'm late!\NJust Taichi and Inaban?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:12.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Kiriyama and Aoki aren't here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:16.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Darn. I sprinted up the stairs for just you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.77,0:06:19.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:24.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not like it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:26.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:28.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,120 yen per peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:30.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're charging for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:34.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though, the price is pretty fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:38.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your next article, Nagase?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.29,0:06:44.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about what the CRC News really needs,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:49.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I've concluded that we have a serious lack of {\i1}erotic{\i0} and {\i1}dangerous{\i0} material.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.42,0:06:54.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}No one's looking for that sort of excitement from our newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.39,0:06:56.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I think we need something like that every so often!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:07:00.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}So, Inaban, why don't we go for something {\i1}erotic{\i0} this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.27,0:07:03.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Don't make a pure, first-year maiden write an erotic article.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:05.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to write the article.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:09.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just need to let me take a few erotic pictures of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:11.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like hell I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:14.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, you fit the pretty type better than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.95,0:07:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That kind of stuff suits you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.74,0:07:20.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no. I'm the idol type that you don't shoot nude.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:25.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}For something more {\i1}voluptuous{\i0}, Inaban makes a much better subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.75,0:07:30.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Voluptuous? I doubt a high school boy would need anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:34.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, don't you think some "adult charm" is exactly what they're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.10,0:07:37.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then let's ask a high school boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.47,0:07:39.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:45.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, right.\NWhich one of us would you rather see strip, Taichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.27,0:07:48.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.57,0:07:52.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, if I were to represent all high school boys, then I'd say,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:54.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Both of you strip!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:08:02.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,3:55 p.m. Yaegashi Taichi commands two female club members to strip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:02.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaban, did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.96,0:08:06.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course. This is going in the editorial postscript.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.79,0:08:11.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I can't deny it because I {\i1}did{\i0} say it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:15.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but could you at least make the name anonymous?\NNo, {\i1}please{\i0} make it anonymous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.51,0:08:21.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...\NWhat's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:28.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, we thought we should tell you about this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...now that we're here, it's kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.07,0:08:35.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It kind of takes a bit of courage to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.41,0:08:36.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:39.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.95,0:08:43.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, last night, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.97,0:08:54.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We switched souls!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.26,0:08:58.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.26,0:09:02.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you that Yui and I switched souls!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:09:03.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like something out of a comic!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:05.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow! Nice tomahawk chop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.77,0:09:07.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The punchline wasn't as good as the lead-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.85,0:09:11.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a joke! I'm being completely serious here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.57,0:09:17.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}I'm more surprised that a bad punchline means a chop from Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:21.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe Yui's rejected you so much that you're deluding yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.70,0:09:23.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That would make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.29,0:09:26.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many times have you confessed to her, only to be ignored?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:32.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not the problem here!\NIt happened to Yui too!\NRight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.51,0:09:39.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I woke up last night,\NI looked around and realized I was in a room I'd never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.68,0:09:42.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And in the mirror, I saw Yui's face and panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:46.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But before I knew it, I was back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:48.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The same thing happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:52.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought it was a bad dream and buried myself under the covers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.82,0:09:55.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But before I knew it, I was back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.86,0:09:58.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That couldn't possibly have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.32,0:10:00.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It couldn't! It definitely couldn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.78,0:10:04.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aoki! Don't drag me into your weird delusions!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:05.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're turning your back on me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.62,0:10:07.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That had to be a bad dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:12.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you're saying that we had the same kind of dream
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:14.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,where we switched bodies at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.80,0:10:20.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}and that all the stuff I moved in the room when I panicked had moved in reality too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:24.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just a bunch of coincidences happening all at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:22.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you get what they're saying? {overlap}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:24.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the most part. {overlap}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.39,0:10:25.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:27.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And why is it me and {\i1}you{\i0} of all people?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:32.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm guessing it's fate or destiny or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.23,0:10:34.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So why don't we just start dating right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.44,0:10:37.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What led you to that conclusion? {overlap}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.19,0:10:38.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You keep saying creepy stuff like that! {\i1}That's{\i0} why!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.61,0:10:42.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori! This pervert wants me to do weird things!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.37,0:10:43.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, there. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.95,0:10:46.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.66,0:10:51.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't understand {\i1}any{\i0} of this!\NWill you two just quit it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:54.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:57.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't understand any of this either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:05.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forgot my notebook in the classroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.81,0:11:07.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't change the topic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.68,0:11:12.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Relax, relax!\NSo, mind if I go get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.69,0:11:17.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the club president.\NDon't ask me for permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.82,0:11:20.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. We can talk more about this later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.82,0:11:26.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori's the one person you can't handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.49,0:11:30.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Guess this is Iori-chan's way of being considerate.\NOr is it just coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.87,0:11:35.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's hard to tell because she may have planned this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.38,0:11:40.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't we have some tea for now?\NI'll make some for Nagase too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:42.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.74,0:12:12.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wasn't I...\NMy voice?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:19.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way...\NAre these...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:42.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Are these...\NAre they... {\i1}those{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.19,0:12:44.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's my first time touching them, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:49.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a girl's... a woman's...\Nthings that start with a 'b'?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.16,0:12:51.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase-san, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.42,0:12:57.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Nagase-san"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.55,0:13:06.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.55,0:13:09.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase-san, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.64,0:13:11.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.97,0:13:13.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should I do it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:18.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Don't you think it's better if someone else does it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.23,0:13:18.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In many ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:22.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No, I'm good, thanks.\NDon't be shy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:27.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm {\i1}very{\i0} good with my hands.\NL-Let's take a step back, Fujishima.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.11,0:13:31.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll come to an understanding if we just talk things through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.41,0:13:35.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's talk...\Nwith our bodies!\NO-Our bodies?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:37.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:39.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me?\NYaegashi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.09,0:13:46.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujishima-san, if you needed Taichi—I mean, me—I mean, Nagase Iori, then I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:48.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is urgent, so I'm taking her with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.05,0:13:52.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're busy right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.05,0:13:56.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It did look like things were going to get {\i1}very{\i0} busy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:56.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, Fujishima!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:13:59.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See? Taichi—I mean, Nagase wants to go too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.69,0:14:03.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something weird about the way you two are talking right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:05.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Either way, if you're taking Nagase-san, at least tell me why you're taking her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.57,0:14:07.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.11,0:14:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.87,0:14:14.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.87,0:14:18.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Nagase! You {\i1}are{\i0} Nagase, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.87,0:14:19.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're me right now, so don't do anything weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:22.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that's good enough! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:35.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:39.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was looking for my notebook, then suddenly I was in the club room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.77,0:14:39.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone called me Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.94,0:14:45.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I freaked out and ran to the classroom.\NAoki and Kiriyama were telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.78,0:14:53.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of joke is this supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.53,0:14:57.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like we switched bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:57.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me and Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:15:03.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never seen Taichi smile without a care in the world like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:07.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's usually something else behind it.\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.80,0:15:11.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's got a good face, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.80,0:15:14.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Girls would be all over him if he always smiled like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:17.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is the way I smile {\i1}that{\i0} bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:20.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think I care about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.69,0:15:23.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You totally hurt your hand just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.69,0:15:23.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.19,0:15:34.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Practicing a dance, Inaban?{lmao}{sutai is a slut}\NI got this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.37,0:15:40.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}She heard Taichi voicing another one of his unnecessary observations
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:43.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and was going to punish him physically for it as usual,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:50.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but then she realized, "Wait, it's actually Iori-chan!" and stopped herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.13,0:15:50.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An idiot like Aoki talking down to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:54.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for you, Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:57.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I've never seen Inaba so happy before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.76,0:16:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll get you back for that one, Tai—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.76,0:16:08.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaban, you were just about to call Nagase Iori "Taichi."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.52,0:16:08.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.36,0:16:12.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you two keep putting on this stupid act!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.36,0:16:14.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think Taichi could pretend to be me {\i1}this{\i0} well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.07,0:16:18.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba, you might not believe it, but please try.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.50,0:16:22.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Yaegashi Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:26.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yui, Aoki, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:30.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}There's no doubt in my mind that Taichi and Iori-chan switched bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:30.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree, Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.09,0:16:35.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I have to accept it.\NOh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.59,0:16:40.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you'll have to accept {\i1}our{\i0} switch too.\NI will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.43,0:16:43.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, with Iori and Taichi like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.43,0:16:46.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But don't you all think you're accepting it way too easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:51.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Well, if it happened to you, all you could say is "Oh, that's what happened!"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.24,0:16:54.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is giving me a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.45,0:16:56.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll ask you one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.53,0:17:00.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're saying that you're not just trying to screw with me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.53,0:17:05.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}and that Iori's and Taichi's personalities {\i1}really{\i0} got switched?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.83,0:17:11.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}That means that you know things only Taichi would know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.09,0:17:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Ask me anything you want.\NYou have less than one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.68,0:17:19.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.51,0:17:22.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the title of the last adult film that Taichi borrowed from Aoki?\N{\i1}High School Girls with Huge Boobs{\i0}—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:25.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of question is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.94,0:17:30.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't even know the answer to it!\NThat doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.65,0:17:33.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aoki's here to check your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:35.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Taichi, what's the answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.11,0:17:37.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.70,0:17:40.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huge boobs, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.70,0:17:44.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Inaba-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.70,0:17:46.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,would you mind if I whispered it into Aoki's ear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.21,0:17:53.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was that the title, Aoki?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.51,0:17:55.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It certainly was, Captain Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:18:00.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}And hearing dirty words from Iori-chan's mouth turned me on a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.39,0:18:04.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, why does it feel like I lost something important?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.31,0:18:08.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that we know that the guys are both boob men,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:10.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,let's see if this one is really Iori.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:17.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Is it just me, or is Inaba simultaneously determining if we're telling the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.11,0:18:21.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and{\i0} getting revenge on us for making fun of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.99,0:18:23.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope I never get on Inaba's bad side...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.50,0:18:31.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait! Inaban, are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:37.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:41.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I guess that's how we grow up...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:45.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did Inaba-chan just tell her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.39,0:18:46.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you switched personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.31,0:18:48.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.85,0:18:57.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}If we compare the probability of Taichi being able to show this much emotion, even if he were acting,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.02,0:18:59.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the probability of people switching personalities,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:03.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the latter is far greater.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:06.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to respond to that opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:09.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, what are you going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:12.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.17,0:19:16.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aoki, Kiriyama, how long were you switched for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:18.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,30 or 40 minutes, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.67,0:19:19.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's for a set amount of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:22.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.85,0:19:33.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?\NDid something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.69,0:19:39.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're back to normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.32,0:19:43.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.70,0:19:47.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe that really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.70,0:19:52.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe we could just say that it's been a strange day?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.70,0:19:52.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.70,0:19:55.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was it just a one-day phenomenon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.84,0:19:58.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was it just something that happened to you four?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.21,0:20:04.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In any case, let's not tell anyone about it for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.34,0:20:09.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want my family to worry about me.\NYeah, and I doubt that anyone would believe us if we did.{fotc}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.23,0:20:24.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was it really only a one-day thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.86,0:20:24.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:26.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.\NThanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.20,0:20:31.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Himeko, you're home?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:35.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously, are you blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.63,0:20:38.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up? You seem angrier than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.71,0:20:43.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing. This is how I always am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.71,0:20:45.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Onee, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.13,0:20:45.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't look so good this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:49.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm fine.\NI just didn't get enough sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.27,0:20:51.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello?\NMom?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.15,0:21:09.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're working late again today?\NIt's okay! I already ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.49,0:21:10.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't overwork yourself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.37,0:21:11.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.25,0:21:17.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.29,0:21:21.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey. Heading home now?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.46,0:21:23.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had a meeting that ran really late.\NI'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.05,0:21:27.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a rough day.\NHow about some ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.05,0:21:31.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan, stop treating me like such a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.05,0:21:32.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm in fifth grade now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:34.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you don't want any?\NI do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:57.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you three switch bodies this time, or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.54,0:22:02.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is your name the same as some obscure plant's?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.33,0:22:02.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once it happens, it's too late!\NI'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.42,0:22:08.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,not him, after all.
